<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.tab_bar.title")}
        description="RML 标签栏组件分为两种：TabBar（原生 header-only 标签栏，纯 header 切换）与 Tabs（WPF TabControl 风格，header + body 一体化切换）。子项统一用 Tab 标签（底层为 TabItem），label 指定标题，icon 添加图标。5 种 variant（underline/pill/flat/outline/segmented）通过独立布尔属性切换；尺寸用 size 属性；prefix/suffix 注入首尾元素；menu 模式启用下拉；on-click 事件回调选中索引。内容面板（body）与 bordered 边框包裹为 Tabs 专属能力。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>演示效果</h3>
                <p>{status_text}</p>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.basic")}</h3>
                    <p>TabBar 仅渲染 header；下方内容面板需自行绑定 selected-index（VS Code 风格：选中 tab 与 body 同色衔接）：</p>
                    <div class="tab-strip-with-body">
                        <TabBar connect-body="" selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                            <Tab label="Account" />
                            <Tab label="Profile" />
                            <Tab label="Settings" />
                        </TabBar>
                        <div class="tab-body-panel">
                            <p>{basic_body_text}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.variants")}</h3>
                    <TabBar>
                        <Tab label="Underline" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar pill>
                        <Tab label="Pill" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar flat>
                        <Tab label="Flat" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar outline>
                        <Tab label="Outline" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar segmented>
                        <Tab label="Segmented" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.sizes")}</h3>
                    <TabBar size="xsmall">
                        <Tab label="xsmall" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar size="small">
                        <Tab label="small" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                    <TabBar size="large">
                        <Tab label="large" />
                        <Tab label="B" />
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.with_icon")}</h3>
                    <TabBar>
                        <Tab icon="User" label="Account" />
                        <Tab icon="Bell" label="Notifications" />
                        <Tab icon="Settings" label="Settings" />
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.disabled")}</h3>
                    <TabBar>
                        <Tab label="Normal" />
                        <Tab label="Disabled" disabled="true" />
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.menu")}</h3>
                    <TabBar menu="true">
                        <Tab label="Tab 1" />
                        <Tab label="Tab 2" />
                        <Tab label="Tab 3" />
                        <Tab label="Tab 4" />
                        <Tab label="Tab 5" />
                        <Tab label="Tab 6" />
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>header 自定义插槽 slot="header"</h3>
                    <p>当 label + icon 不足以表达标题时，用 template slot="header" 注入任意元素：</p>
                    <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                        <Tab>
                            <template slot="header">
                                <span>Account</span>
                                <Badge>3</Badge>
                            </template>
                        </Tab>
                        <Tab>
                            <template slot="header">
                                <span>Profile</span>
                            </template>
                        </Tab>
                    </TabBar>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>Tabs bordered（边框包裹 header + body）</h3>
                    <p>WPF TabControl 风格，bordered 属性启用 1px 边框包裹 header + body 整体；选中 tab 背景与 body 同为 surface（Tabs 专属）：</p>
                    <Tabs bordered="" selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                        <Tab label="Account">
                            <div class="tab-body">
                                <p>Account settings panel (bordered)</p>
                            </div>
                        </Tab>
                        <Tab label="Profile">
                            <div class="tab-body">
                                <p>User profile panel (bordered)</p>
                            </div>
                        </Tab>
                    </Tabs>
                </div>

                <div class="demo-section">
                    <h3>Tabs 内容面板 body</h3>
                    <p>Tab 直接包裹 element 子节点作为选中时渲染的内容（WPF TabControl/TabItem 模式，Tabs 专属）：</p>
                    <Tabs selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                        <Tab label="Account">
                            <div class="tab-body">
                                <p>Account settings panel</p>
                            </div>
                        </Tab>
                        <Tab label="Profile">
                            <div class="tab-body">
                                <p>User profile panel</p>
                            </div>
                        </Tab>
                        <Tab label="Settings">
                            <div class="tab-body">
                                <p>System settings panel</p>
                            </div>
                        </Tab>
                    </Tabs>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>
        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Tabs</h3>
            <Table columns={tabs_api_columns} rows={tabs_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>TabBar</h3>
            <Table columns={tab_bar_api_columns} rows={tab_bar_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>Tab</h3>
            <Table columns={tab_api_columns} rows={tab_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
